# storybook-annotakit demo — GitHub mirror config (OPTIONAL)
#
# Local mode works with ZERO config: pinning, threads, digests, resolve.
# Copy this file to .env, fill in, then (re)start the demo dev server —
# .env is read once at boot.
#
# .env holds a SECRET: it is gitignored — never commit or publish it.

# Classic PAT with repo scope (github.com/settings/tokens).
ANNOTAKIT_GH_TOKEN=

# Issue-landing repo (owner/name). Default: git-remote/package.json autodetect.
# ANNOTAKIT_GH_REPO=yourorg/your-feedback-repo

# Labels applied to created issues (comma/space separated) — give each
# workstream sharing a feedback repo its own label set.
# ANNOTAKIT_GH_LABELS=annotakit

# Remote pull interval in seconds (default 60; 0 = pull only on POST /sync).
# ANNOTAKIT_GH_POLL=60
